Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the Binary Response Writer not properly handling wildcard fields in queries, which resulted in those fields not being included in the response when requested. The logic that determined whether only pseudo fields should be returned did not account for cases where wildcard fields were requested, leading to incomplete responses.

